WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.680
What happens when you introduce SCP-914 to&nbsp;
one of the world's first computer viruses?

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.040
Dr. Manheim prepared one USB drive with a text&nbsp;
file, containing the source code of the computer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.160
virus Creeper. No organic materials were used&nbsp;
for the test, out of concern for potentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.600
biohazardous effects. A hazmat team was placed&nbsp;
on standby for the duration of the experiment.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.920
The infected USB drive was placed into&nbsp;
the Clockworks on the setting "Very Fine."&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.800
The output produced was a metallic green figure&nbsp;
with a cylindrical shape. As soon as it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.960
removed from SCP-914, the object self-destructed&nbsp;
in a manner resembling an ordinary firework.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.160
All in all, the experiment was extremely&nbsp;
anticlimactic, and a bit disappointing.

